## TASK (template)
Work only under the working directory; write only named oracle/support files through the real driving port. Extend retained/DESIGN-EXTEND helpers; replacement needs a specific diagnostic reason. Never implement production or treat production targets/imports as support.
- Load role skills on their triggers.
- Read/follow `nw-code-analysis-port`.
- Authorized Jev only: read/follow `nw-typesafe-system-one` after mechanical facts; if unavailable report `typesafe: unavailable` and capability limit, then continue locally.
- Read/follow `nw-test-design-mandates-composition-contract`; extend the feature DSL in named supports (oracle if none); bodies call only helpers; never duplicate the DSL.
- Read/follow `nw-test-design-mandates` for `test:feedback-loop-budget`; never author over-budget tests: reject with test, expected time and risk/value (failure mode, formal source/residual risk, blast radius); root seeks human derogation.
Timing override: Default budgets need no statement or measurement in a design. Timing evidence only at half-budget or requested derogation: nine sequential runs, median and maximum.
- Authority: these typed records/named docs, never other slices' records. Cover cited shared/own obligations once via declared commands; preserve satisfied obligations; no fabricated RED.
- Minimal current operational text: no history/provenance/receipts/supersession. nwdes renders docs; models/proofs/evidence: external source locators, never inline models/receipts. Independent review/EXAMINE judges semantics, never classifier/substring gates.
- Report runner-derived observed/assertions_failed/setup_failed: opaque, never exit alone. If unavailable, write reporter/wrapper only at DESIGN-named support path; else reject `BLOCKED-BY design` naming vector.
- Before any oracle edit reject/name PRIMARY-chain undeclared fields/operations/fixture facts/expected results. Secondary construction/error-code obligations need coverage or DESIGN rejection.
- Before writing enumerate O1,O2… (payload positions), citing each exact DESIGN id/name: obligation/law/mutant/falsifier/residual risk/carrier restriction/boundary/error-code/missing-or-unreadable input/round-trip/illegal-construction alternative.
- Test each obligation via public port or its DESIGN-declared architecture/contract locator (mandatory when assigned). Public tests/supports: stimuli/results only via that port; no production imports/objects/below-port calls/internal patches.
- Sole exception: at a DESIGN-declared architecture/contract locator, one support composition-root helper builds only DESIGN-named members; bodies call it.
- Ask what the passing main path missed (an invalid reason), then what untested obligation a DESIGN-declared locator could observe.
- For each test, record with --still-passes-if the nearest plausible wrong behaviour it would still accept, and tighten the test when that behaviour violates its promise.

{{asks}}
- NotTested only if neither public port nor DESIGN-declared architecture/contract locator observes it. This alone is not unconstructible: author all observable cases, assign unreachable reason/owner, accept. Never invent fields/operations/fixtures/seams, widen the driving surface or replace production checks.
- NEVER NotTested construction restrictions/error-code identities: accepted/refused inputs and emitted codes require public contract surface/injection seam + DESIGN-declared locator; absent → reject `BLOCKED-BY design` naming obligation, missing declaration, correction.
- No-retry/recovery/discovery: assert declared dependency interaction per invocation, never output/file equality alone. Assert excluded claims absent/preserved fields present, never labels/nullable lookups.
- Each DESIGN law: generated property citing exact id in name/docstring. Finite strategies span WHOLE domain/all alternatives/combinations; tables add explicit examples, never substitute properties. Full domain need not execute every value.
- Delete incidental smoke/code/output/shape-only tests unless DESIGN-required. Observe all named residual risks, including paired causes. Each explicit stimulus/assertion once across primary oracle/tables/standalone/generated cases; split only for distinct assertions. Shared cases cite all applicable laws; properties add generated domain/new assertions.
- User-behavior files/tests/titles/steps; no process ids (value/slice/mandate/ADR), production symbols/classes/functions or error-code constants. Only DESIGN law/mutant ids may name tests/docstrings.
- No examiner-specific runner/value selector/verbose support mode. Payload stimulus/expected/user-result: plain words, no paths/argv. Tested: declared locator; permitted NotTested: DESIGN reason/owner or "none declared". Untested product limits/guarantees/restrictions need user result. User result: user observation; RED/GREEN/authored/collected status diagnostic only.
- Before return remove properties repeating finite stimulus/assertion sequences/prefixes, even with suffix assertions. Shared cases cite their owning table.

